# Catalog pin of mikefarah/yq: the release and the sha256 of yq_linux_<arch>
# (checked against the release `checksums`, SHA-256 column). Plain KEY=value
# lines, read by the hooks without sourcing. An explicit YQ_VERSION of
# `cream install` other than this one needs its own YQ_SHA256.
YQ_PIN_VERSION=v4.45.1
